&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Identify, engage, and sign high-potential retail partners across Munich, from leading supermarket chains and specialty retailers to innovative local businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Own Your Territory&lt;/h3&gt;
